 HOW TO TEST SLICE 2B
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

STEP 1  cd ~/Desktop/CodePulse/backend
STEP 2  ./mvnw test
        Expect: Tests run: 45, Failures: 0, Errors: 0   BUILD SUCCESS
STEP 3  CP="target/classes:$(cat target/classpath.txt)"
        (if target/classpath.txt is missing, rebuild it:
         ./mvnw -q dependency:build-classpath -Dmdep.outputFile=target/classpath.txt)
STEP 4  java -cp "$CP" dev.codepulse.ParseMain src/test/resources/fixtures/declarations/Declarations.java
        Output:
          status: PARSED
          types:   class 2, interface 1, enum 1, record 1, annotation 1, anonymous 1
          members: method 10, constructor 3, executable 11, lambda 2
        Compare with the hand tally at the bottom of the fixture file.
STEP 5  Try it on any file in the project, e.g. PackageSummary.java,
        and count its methods yourself first.
